  "id": "chorizo-and-root-vegetable-bulgur-salad",
  "name": "Chorizo and Root Vegetable Bulgur Salad",
  "subtitle": "Roasted vegetables and smoky sausage tossed with lemony bulgur",
  "description": "A warm, hearty salad combining roasted root vegetables, chorizo, bulgur wheat, lemon, and parsley.",
